n></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ernesto-sabato"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ernesto-sabato.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ernesto Sabato</span><span class="tp">1911–2011</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/claudia-sheinbaum"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/claudia-sheinbaum.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Claudia Sheinbaum</span><span class="tp">b. 1962</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
